<title>USA: Eli Lilly and Co Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Eli Lilly and Co Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997		     1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.79		    $0.71</p>
<p> Net			432,600		  389,200</p>
<p> Revs		   1,953,000		1,783,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs			NA			 NA</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 1997 results after one-time charge of $24 million from decision to discontinue a collaboration with Somatogen Inc. Excluding charge, Q1 1997 operating income was $0.82 a share.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
